  "The Additional Custom Field module in eCommerceGo SAAS empowers businesses to enrich their products with customized fields, enabling them to gather precise and relevant information. This module is particularly beneficial for industries such as spas, clinics, or other appointment-based services where capturing detailed client information is essential. By leveraging this feature, admins can create tailored data fields that enhance the overall product configuration and booking experience, ensuring that the collected information aligns with their specific business needs": "eCommerceGo SAAS 中的附加自定义字段模块使企业能够通过自定义字段丰富其产品，从而使他们能够收集准确且相关的信息。",
